WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.667
I want to

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:01.501
turn to

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.769
something on the Democratic side

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:03.870
that emerged this weekend.

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:04.471
There is growing

00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:05.238
angst that

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:06.106
potential potential

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:08.141
third party challengers

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:09.542
Robert Kennedy Jr.

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:09.943
And Marianne

00:00:09.943 --> 00:00:11.211
Williamson could really hurt

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:13.980
president biden's reelection chances.

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.648
RFK Jr.

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:16.950
The New York Post reports

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.285
with video it's not just their account

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:22.455
spreading some really deranged lies

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:24.424
about the CO, about COVID,

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:27.093
that they really walk into anti-Semitism

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:28.561
and anti-Asian bigotry.

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:30.330
The New York Post has a tape of Kennedy

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:32.132
saying, quote, COVID 19.

00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:33.566
There's an argument that it is

00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:34.801
ethnically targeted.

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:35.402
COVID 19

00:00:35.402 --> 00:00:37.103
is targeted to attack Caucasians

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:38.271
and black people.

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:39.406
The people who are most immune

00:00:39.406 --> 00:00:41.141
are Ashkenazi Jews and Chinese.

00:00:41.141 --> 00:00:41.674
We don't know

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:43.343
know whether it's deliberately targeted

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:43.877
that or not.

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:44.911
We do know that the Chinese

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:45.545
are spending hundreds

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:46.279
of millions of dollars

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:47.881
developing ethno

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:49.916
ethnic bioweapon INS, unquote.

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:52.285
There is no truth to this.

00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:53.119
There are

00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:55.889
plenty of Ashkenazi Jews

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:58.058
and plenty of Chinese and Asian people

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:00.660
died of COVID.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:03.229
It's a deranged argument.

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:04.697
But this guy is posing.

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:06.366
He's polling in the double digits

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:07.233
among Democrats.

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:07.834
Well, but again,

00:01:07.834 --> 00:01:09.002
I think that is about more about

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:10.103
name recognition.

00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:12.138
His own family doesn't support him.

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:12.872
And as you just said,

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:14.174
that is a deranged,

00:01:14.174 --> 00:01:16.142
disgusting thing to say.

00:01:16.142 --> 00:01:17.510
Let's just be very clear.

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.945
It does not represent the values

00:01:18.945 --> 00:01:20.280
of the Democratic Party.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:22.115
So I think when voters he's

00:01:22.115 --> 00:01:22.916
not on the ballot

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:23.583
in any states,

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:24.717
and I think when voters actually

00:01:24.717 --> 00:01:26.920
get to hear him say things like that,

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:28.321
those numbers will fall.

00:01:28.321 --> 00:01:29.422
I'm not concerned.

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:31.124
And as the congresswoman said,

00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:32.725
the fundraising numbers from the Biden

00:01:32.725 --> 00:01:35.528
campaign are just shot up.

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:37.831
The people who have been you know,

00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:39.132
wringing their hands,

00:01:39.132 --> 00:01:40.667
we see it every cycle.

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:42.569
I'm very confident

00:01:42.569 --> 00:01:44.137
in President Biden's ability

00:01:44.137 --> 00:01:45.438
to run a solid campaign.

00:01:45.438 --> 00:01:46.372
And the last thing I'll say

00:01:46.372 --> 00:01:48.675
very quickly is in part because,

00:01:49.175 --> 00:01:49.909
you know,

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:51.978
a lot of what 20, 24 is going to be about

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:53.313
is who is an idiot

00:01:53.313 --> 00:01:54.447
who gets to be an American.

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:55.548
When we talk about the defense

00:01:55.548 --> 00:01:57.183
authorization bill,

00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:58.785
I mean, a lot of what is in

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:02.722
there are anti LGBTQ, anti-woman, anti

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:03.423
civil rights.

00:02:03.423 --> 00:02:05.058
And we're seeing this at the state level.

00:02:05.058 --> 00:02:07.160
We're seeing this at the federal level.

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:09.162
And it's calling it culture wars.

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:10.730
That's a disservice.

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:11.264
Yeah.

00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:13.366
So I want to say on Karen's point, too,

00:02:13.366 --> 00:02:14.300
about the people

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:16.102
who have been kind of underestimating

00:02:16.102 --> 00:02:17.203
President Biden,

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:18.705
I think that his fundraising

00:02:18.705 --> 00:02:19.839
numbers need to be a wake up

00:02:19.839 --> 00:02:21.841
call to Republicans as well,

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:23.076
because I feel like a lot of

00:02:23.076 --> 00:02:24.477
people are pointing to his low

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:26.279
approval ratings and everything

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:27.814
but if Republicans nominate

00:02:27.814 --> 00:02:29.315
someone like Donald Trump,

00:02:29.315 --> 00:02:30.950
then Biden could

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:32.619
succeed and win reelection.

00:02:32.619 --> 00:02:34.621
But I think if we put up anyone else,

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:36.556
we could pose a threat to Biden.

00:02:36.556 --> 00:02:37.824
But these fundraising numbers

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:38.658
are really strong.

00:02:38.658 --> 00:02:39.425
Any thoughts on

00:02:39.425 --> 00:02:41.027
what Robert Kennedy had to say?

00:02:41.027 --> 00:02:41.561
I mean, I can't

00:02:41.561 --> 00:02:42.829
I have to echo the fact

00:02:42.829 --> 00:02:44.531
that it's nauseating and disgusting

00:02:44.531 --> 00:02:45.265
and divisive

00:02:45.265 --> 00:02:46.933
and the Democratic Party

00:02:46.933 --> 00:02:48.935
has no room for that sort of narrative.

00:02:48.935 --> 00:02:50.737
I don't think he will gain any traction.

00:02:50.737 --> 00:02:52.038
And I'm not worried about it.

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:54.040
I am confident that it will end up

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.975
being a rematch of Biden and Trump.

00:02:55.975 --> 00:02:56.910
And I believe President

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:57.710
Biden will prevail

